## AI & Data Analytics

I've always found it interesting how a lot of useful information can be hidden in data. I enjoy exploring datasets, playing around with numbers, finding patterns, and understanding what they actually tell us.

I'm particularly interested in creating dashboards that make data easier to understand. I like the idea of taking a large amount of raw data, organizing it, turning it into meaningful charts and visuals, and finding insights that might not be obvious at first.

I want to explore more of Python, SQL, Excel, and Power BI and learn how to use them in real-world projects. I'm also curious about how AI and machine learning can be used to understand data, find patterns, and make analysis more useful.

Some things I would love to work on:
- Exploring different datasets and understanding the stories behind them.
- Cleaning and organizing data to make it easier to work with.
- Creating dashboards that are simple, interactive, and easy to understand.
- Finding interesting trends and insights through data analysis.
- Using charts and visualizations to present information clearly.
- Exploring how AI can make data analysis smarter and more efficient.

I'm still learning, experimenting with different tools, and improving my skills through projects. I want to keep building things, learning from my mistakes, and getting better at turning data into something meaningful.
